  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_00",
      "hash64": "7EE9C25EC927EBA9",
      "text": "大伙，抱歉……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "F1B3A41EED808681",
      "text": "１年零几个月前……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "7EE9C15EC927E9F6",
      "text": "抱歉……\\n因为布料没能及时采购到……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "3FEE639A2D55390C",
      "text": "不得了……\\n这长筒靴尤其不得了……[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "7EE9C05EC927E843",
      "text": "那长筒靴的构想\\n源于蓄能焰袭……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "4918872BA1141559",
      "text": "我的制服也和我想象的一样，\\n真是太谢谢你了。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "7EE9BF5EC927E690",
      "text": "如果能还原地狱偶像枇琶大人的构想，\\n那再好不过。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "36523EDB08117B0C",
      "text": "这下所有人的制服都改好了。\\n太谢谢你了，秋明。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "365241DB08118025",
      "text": "你们俩都这么酷毙了的话，\\n应该能给人很大的压迫感吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "0E1DF61F5DCB6AEA",
      "text": "不过，秋明你的手还真是巧啊～[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "0E1DF51F5DCB6937",
      "text": "那些只因为你是个宅男\\n就霸凌你的家伙们都是傻瓜啊～[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_04",
      "hash64": "7EE9C65EC927F275",
      "text": "宅人所走的路是修罗相伴的荆棘之路。\\n吾不奢望能获得凡人的理解。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "3FEE669A2D553E25",
      "text": "哟呵！这是怎么了，秋明！\\n你说的话很有底气嘛！[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "4918842BA1141040",
      "text": "是啊，秋明。\\n我觉得你很酷哦～[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "365240DB08117E72",
      "text": "那么，为了备战天星大作战，\\n接下来我们做战斗的特训吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "36523BDB081175F3",
      "text": "我们身为老大，\\n可不能比其他成员弱啊。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_05",
      "hash64": "7EE9C55EC927F0C2",
      "text": "明白……\\n吾会全心全力不断修炼……！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_06",
      "hash64": "7EE9C45EC927EF0F",
      "text": "虽说要全心全力，\\n但最高原则是不可违抗的……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_07",
      "hash64": "7EE9C35EC927ED5C",
      "text": "最高原则就是队的规矩……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_08",
      "hash64": "7EE9CA5EC927F941",
      "text": "既然是规矩，那么这个……\\n就可以给You了。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "D28430A2470ED9B9",
      "text": "这个机关也请收下，\\n里面记录了发射垃圾的招式。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_09",
      "hash64": "7EE9C95EC927F78E",
      "text": "You的名字是……\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]啊。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_10",
      "hash64": "7EE63C5EC924D220",
      "text": "这是一场鲜明的惨败，\\n甚至没有一丝仇恨和痛苦……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_01",
      "hash64": "E6637BEF86A2512B",
      "text": "秋明！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_11",
      "hash64": "7EE63D5EC924D3D3",
      "text": "同、同胞？[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "BD2F1C2F0598E27F",
      "text": "他说无论如何都要见你，\\n然后和你直接说话。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_02",
      "hash64": "E6637CEF86A252DE",
      "text": "秋明，听我说！\\n让我说几句就好！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_12",
      "hash64": "7EE63E5EC924D586",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "BD2F1D2F0598E432",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_13",
      "hash64": "7EE63F5EC924D739",
      "text": "……你为何到这里来？[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_03",
      "hash64": "E6637DEF86A25491",
      "text": "因为我想救你这个同胞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_04",
      "hash64": "E6637EEF86A25644",
      "text": "如果像这样一直不上学的话，\\n秋明你就会受到退学处分，不是吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_14",
      "hash64": "7EE6405EC924D8EC",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_05",
      "hash64": "E6637FEF86A257F7",
      "text": "以前一直被霸凌的我们\\n现在能去上学……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_06",
      "hash64": "E66380EF86A259AA",
      "text": "这都要归功于天星队为大家\\n努力执行的那个大作战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_07",
      "hash64": "E66381EF86A25B5D",
      "text": "你们这样的人退学，\\n我绝对不能接受！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_15",
      "hash64": "7EE6415EC924DA9F",
      "text": "……抱歉。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_08",
      "hash64": "E66372EF86A241E0",
      "text": "现在还联系不上\\n那个叫真老大的人吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_16",
      "hash64": "7EE6425EC924DC52",
      "text": "嗯，自从那天之后就……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_17",
      "hash64": "7EE6435EC924DE05",
      "text": "没有真老大，\\n就没有天星队……没有天星队\\r\\n就没有令人欣喜的学院生活！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
